-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
 HOW TO REGENERATE
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

Produce the raw inventory with:

  bunx license-checker-rseidelsohn --production --summary
  bunx license-checker-rseidelsohn --production --json > /tmp/licenses.json

Then curate by hand. Do not commit the raw tool output as the NOTICE file: it
lists hundreds of transitive dependencies, most of which need no notice, and it
does not record dual license elections or the obligations above, which are the
parts that actually matter.

Review this file whenever a direct dependency is added or a major version is
released.
